                                                "sense_id": "c91e44a7-2d13-33b6-8f21-538b84794ece",
                                                "text": "Villagers use the nematicides Furadan and Mocap mostly in banana cultivation, whereas Basudin and Sevin are the most frequently used agrochemicals applied exclusively on nonbanana crops."
                                            },
